error[NK2202]: `made` is `sync`, but the cleanup of `Res`, `Res::cleanup`, can pause.
   --> tests/a_pausing_cleanup_of_a_value_lent_to_a_call_in_a_sync_function_is_nk2202.nika:30:5
    |
 30 |     take(Res { name: "b" })
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: A `sync` function promises never to pause or do I/O.
    = note: `Res` is cleaned up where it dies in `made`, and `Res::cleanup` doesn't say `sync`.
    = help: Remove `sync` from `made`, write `sync` after the signature of `Res::cleanup` if it never pauses, or create `Res` outside `made` and pass it in.
